        "TileImage": "$($repository 02e6c302-dcce-4109-b1fa-b4ce1b6f4159).Image",
        "Description": "Agent 47, we have an intriguing contract from the none other than The Delgado Drug Family. They&#39;ve been swindled by their supplier, the Ragnarok Disciples, a biker gang based in Berlin. The Disciples utilize motorcycles to distribute weed, primarily from an abandoned building attached to Club Holl&#235;. \nOur task: dismantle the Disciples. Though lacking a formal leader, they lean on three pillars. \rFirstly, Meinrad Vogts, known as the Mechanic, is crucial for bike maintenance. Disabling him halts their transportation. \rSecondly, Karl J Mattsson, aka the Botanist, oversees cannabis cultivation. His removal cripples their supply chain. \rLastly, Franz Everhart, the Link, is a childhood of Rolf Hirschm&#252;ller, The owner of Club Holl&#235;.  Everhard Maintans the disciples connection with the club, he is vital for their base. Without him, they risk losing their headquarters.\n\n\rPrepare accordingly, Agent 47.",
